WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.360
Ethereum remains the foundation of decentralized finance.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:18.120
UNCX is fully compatible with Ethereum, providing secure liquidity locking, token minting and

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.360
staking solutions for projects building on-chain.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.400
Liquidity security is crucial for Ethereum-based projects.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.920
UNCX liquidity lockers prevent unauthorized withdrawal, ensuring stability and long-term

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.360
investor confidence.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.120
Launching tokens on Ethereum has never been easier.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:38.760
With UNCX's no-code token minter, developers can deploy secure ERC-20 tokens in minutes,

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.880
eliminating the complexity of smart contract development.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:47.240
UNCX staking solutions ensure that Ethereum projects can offer sustainable rewards, optimising

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:51.240
token distribution and encouraging long-term participation.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.760
UNCX tools are built with Ethereum security standards in mind.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:01:00.280
Every transaction is on-chain, ensuring transparency, immutability and trust for all participants.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:04.600
Ethereum projects require security, liquidity and efficient token management.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.520
UNCX provides the trusted solutions needed to build, scale and secure DeFi applications

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:11.520
on Ethereum with confidence.
